**`waitFor()` helper** (lines 1402-1414):
```typescript
async function waitFor(condition: () => boolean, maxWaitMs = 500): Promise<void> {
  await waitForStartup(
    "dispatch watch test readiness",
    async () => {
      const ok = condition();
      return {
